2. Essential Ingredients of Section 411 IPC: To sustain a conviction under Section 411 IPC, the prosecution must establish:
(1) That the property in question is stolen property within the meaning of Section 410 IPC;
(2) That the property was in the possession of the accused;
(3) That the accused received or retained it dishonestly, knowing or having reason to believe the same to be stolen property.
